<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="2">

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="3 7/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALEC"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Desk Segment</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Good evening. Welcome to the NoHo Rag. I’m Alec Reidel. Here’s what’s going on in our world. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Coming up later: we’ve got an interview with billionaire entrepreneur </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Elon</Text>
      <Text> Musk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But first, let’s take a look into the incest capitol of the world, Indiana.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You may know it for its illegal fireworks, that gene hackman basketball move and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold">bigotry</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That’s right, Indiana governor Mike Pence signed </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">RFRA</Text>
      <Text>, the religious freedom restoration act, into law. It’s stated goal is to protect the religious beliefs of business owners...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’m just kidding, it’s because they hate the gays.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The new law allows businesses to deny services to those pesky butt fuckers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Joining us now is John Quincy Steamberg, who runs a business in southern Indiana.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Now Mr. Steamberg is it true that you are now denying service to homosexuals.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>JOHN QUINCY STEAMBERG is wearing a plaid shirt, hair neatly coiffed. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>John</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That’s right! </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Mmmm</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Hmmm</Text>
      <Text>, I don’t want them sullying my fine family establishment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That being the Good Way Sex Emporium?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>John slams a dildo on the desk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Finest fake cocks this side of the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">mississip</Text>
      <Text>! Absolutely!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But, is your hard lined stance not seriously cutting in to your sales?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Don’t care. Don’t need ‘em.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Indiana is drowning in bored housewife poontang.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I can’t restock my shelves fast enough.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I gotta beat them away with a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Tantus</Text>
      <Text> Thwack Paddle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Which, by the way is on sale for $19.95</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>So hypothetically, if a homosexual man were to enter your emporium.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(sotto)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh please, Alec. I have a weak heart.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And the man asked for a vibrating cock ring.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(sotto)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oddly specific, Alec.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What would you tell him?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Well Alec, I would avert my eyes, as my church tells me to do.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I would then politely explain that my religion expressly forbids me from dealing sexual wares to subversive mental aberrations.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Subversive mental </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">whatnows</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The gays, Alec. The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold">gays</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But you are aware that after great public outcry the bill was amended to prevent sexual orientation discrimination.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>To be honest, Alec, it was only a matter of time. These are the breaks of being a bigot.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Luckily, there are plenty of other groups I can freely discriminate against.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh no...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>People who wear mittens, people born in July</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(sotto)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Arrogant fucks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And psychiatrists.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Psychiatrists?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They’re into some weird shit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Why, just the other day one of those barbarians came sauntering in and asked for the fifty shades of grey pleasure balls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>A steal at $34.95.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But, I roundly refused to sell to that antisocial enemy of the people.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That’s not very Christian.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Christian? Oh </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Xenu</Text>
      <Text>, no.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’m a Scientologist! </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">OT-7</Text>
      <Text>, baby! Just another hundred grand, and I’m clear!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’re being swindled, John Quincy Steamberg. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Thanks for coming on the Rag!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>END JOHN INTERVIEW WITH HANDSHAKE.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Rand Paul, second-generation idiot, has announced his bid for joke candidate 2016.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The Kentucky native hopes to destroy the Washington machine by taking control of it and running it into the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>This is like becoming a German Wings </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">co-pilot</Text>
      <Text> just to crash your plane in the French </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Alpes</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec gives a shit-eating grin into the camera for a beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Sony Pictures is resurrecting the Ghostbusters franchise after decades of speculation.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Rather than the Ernie Hudson vehicle we all feared, Paul </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Feig</Text>
      <Text> of Freaks and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Geeks</Text>
      <Text> fame is enlisting four of the funniest women alive for the new project.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But Sony didn’t stop there, because they’re imbeciles. And this has made our very own Chip Sterling quite irate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Chip Dance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

